# Zenith Chain

Zenith Chain is a modular Layer 1 blockchain prototype designed for scalability and application-specific infrastructure.

## Overview

This project demonstrates the basic architecture of a customizable blockchain network. It is designed to explore consensus mechanisms, modular execution layers, and token integration.

## Features

- Modular architecture
- Basic consensus simulation
- Token support structure
- Easy customization

## Purpose

This repository is created for educational and experimental purposes to explore blockchain infrastructure design.

## Status

🚧 Work in progress – prototype stage.

